        "density": 0.06851,
        "chars": 222,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 47.68
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222,
        539,
        973,
        675
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Those members who have the titles of attendance teacher, attendance officer, attendance teacher (Spanish speaking), auxiliary attendance teacher, or auxiliary attendance officer, the rate is increased to 8% in accordance with the agreement negotiated between the Office of Staff Relations of the Board of Education and the United Federation of Teachers AFL - CIO.",
